    "detailed_description": "Desperate to rescue his daughter, Eric Preston journeys to a cabin deep in the Canadian wilderness to discover an ancient evil that awaits his arrival. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAssuming the role of this desperate father, players are tasked with solving the the mystery of his daughter's disappearance while warding off the evils that have been unleashed. Faced with tense stealth and close quarters combat, players must collect clues and solve puzzles to discover the truth that lies behind this cabin. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you save your daughter in time or will her suffering mean the end of days?",
